{"term": "Wichser", "lang": "de", "script": "latin", "romanization": null, "category": "insults", "subcategory": "masturbation_insult", "concept": "masturbation_male", "is_novel_concept": false, "register": "slang_crude", "crude": 80, "technical": 5, "recognition_pct_current": 97, "recognition_pct_peak": 97, "peak_year": null, "regional": null, "definition": "Wanker; from wichsen (to masturbate); widely used as a general-purpose insult for a contemptible or worthless person, precisely analogous to British 'wanker'.", "english_term": "wanker", "english_translation_quality": "direct", "notes": "Primary usage is insult register; literal meaning is 'one who masturbates' but functions as a general contempt term; female form is Wichserin."}
